The emulated board in this directory is built from these sources:

  sal.c, sal_video.c, sal_sound.c, sal_sets.c, sal_bus.h, sal.h,
  sal_internal.h, sal_input.c, sal_input.h, sal_port.h
      After MAME's src/mame/konami/nemesis.cpp and nemesis_v.cpp
      (license BSD-3-Clause, copyright-holders Bryan McPhail): the memory
      maps, the latches, the video and the ROM sets. Written for this
      project; GNU General Public License v3.0 (see ../LICENSE).

  romload.c
      The ROM set loader of pico-1943 (from pico-galagino and
      pico-mooncresta); GNU General Public License v3.0.

  musashi/
      Musashi 4.60, the Motorola 68000 emulator by Karl Stenerud
      (https://github.com/kstenerud/Musashi), MIT licence (see the header of
      m68kcpu.c). m68kops.c is the output of its generator, m68kmake, with
      the run-time jump table replaced by the tables of
      tools/m68k_dispatch.py; m68kcpu.c and m68kcpu.h are patched to use
      them (and to leave out the bus error state, the FPU and the MMU).
      m68kconf.h is this project's configuration. softfloat/ holds the
      headers m68kcpu.h needs (SoftFloat, John R. Hauser; see its README).

  z80.c, z80.h, z80.lst, z80_ops.h
      MAME's Z80 core (src/devices/cpu/z80, license BSD-3-Clause,
      copyright-holders Juergen Buchmueller, Andrei I. Holub) in plain C, as
      pico-1943 carries it (from pico-galagino and pico-mooncresta); z80_ops.h
      is generated from z80.lst by tools/z80gen.py.

  ym2151.c, ym2151.h
      MAME's src/devices/sound/ym2151.cpp as of MAME 0.229 (license
      GPL-2.0-or-later, copyright-holders Jarek Burczynski, Ernesto Corvi) in
      plain C, the samples made at the output rate.

  k007232.c, k007232.h
      MAME's src/devices/sound/k007232.cpp (license BSD-3-Clause,
      copyright-holders Nicola Salmoria, Hiromitsu Shioya) in plain C.

  vlm5030.c, vlm5030.h
      MAME's src/devices/sound/vlm5030.cpp (license BSD-3-Clause,
      copyright-holder Tatsuyuki Satoh) in plain C, with the chip's
      coefficients from tms5110r.hxx.

